{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香港Hip Hop組合廿四味為紀念成軍20週年，今晚（26日）在黃埔TIDES舉辦《Battle For the Mind》二十週年演唱會，全場爆滿，何超儀、吳彥祖、黃浩然、許懷欣等亦有場支持。</p><figure><img alt=\"廿四味今晚（26日）在黃埔TIDES舉辦《Battle For the Mind》二十週年演唱會。（鍾冠全攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147290312817905664869032.jpeg/D9HCN0zfedVEIJW40lmszxRpVS8cezq57VnjptRZ46Y\"/><figcaption>廿四味今晚（26日）在黃埔TIDES舉辦《Battle For the Mind》二十週年演唱會。（鍾冠全攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何超儀同Iman。（鍾冠全攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147290336847466496751064.jpeg/tl_lU8k0qNVkZNHFRNxzzkQiMeNxRyK_-0CQ-cFAkPk\"/><figcaption>何超儀同Iman。（鍾冠全攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳彥祖。（鍾冠全攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147290330773852160853076.jpeg/SB3nybhOac5I1Z8MxxNeZwWwyFWm8nWHjG6gdrZuoHY\"/><figcaption>吳彥祖。（鍾冠全攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳彥祖。（鍾冠全攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147290328064200704950367.jpeg/pvsdO-AAUhRHKoBe8adk8IYKejMh7oFmo9h455nYeOc\"/><figcaption>吳彥祖。（鍾冠全攝）</figcaption></figure><p>演唱會一開首，廿四味一眾成員阿肥陳偉雄、阿傑梁永傑、陳子聰 、Ghost Style 、李凱賢（Brian）、Eddie Chung，即唱《Hong Kong Kowloon（香港九龍）》 、《Do You Know Me》、《RTPK (Respect Tou Pok Guy)》炒熱氣氛，再緊接唱出《Do or Die》、《Bring it on》，現場氣氛非常熱烈！</p><figure><img alt=\"現場氣氛非常熱烈！（鍾冠全攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147290315884072960396512.jpeg/5wFvW2ISYbHvymCKQd8ECw0FVmjTL01NK3JhCRJyYQk\"/><figcaption>現場氣氛非常熱烈！（鍾冠全攝）</figcaption></figure><p>唱完第一部份，各成員答謝在場fans，阿肥表示見到場中有不少街坊，Brian亦爆粗答謝歌迷：「我好X感動，好X想喊！」</p><figure><img alt=\"成軍20周年！（鍾冠全攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147290309810458624670825.jpeg/KFpLcCiJPschubmWOZOl2tNNt6mT8PEQiMVbW73FW1s\"/><figcaption>成軍20周年！（鍾冠全攝）</figcaption></figure><p>之後第一位表演嘉賓為AGA，上台前Brian介紹道：「呢個嘉賓好畀面，佢退X咗休㗎喇，佢個生活已經好Xchill，佢把聲好X，但首歌講三點凌晨做乜X嘢」，即時令全場充滿笑聲！</p><figure><img alt=\"第一位表演嘉賓為AGA。（鍾冠全攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147290333617721344631508.jpeg/_ZIxmKiuNNM4GXVsKqqewVtH4VlmnLpJDwgz3jkIM94\"/><figcaption>第一位表演嘉賓為AGA。（鍾冠全攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Brian爆粗答謝歌迷。（鍾冠全攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147290325186777088294508.jpeg/CGKEfMz3RDvrVRnifeEHbNBT4SGbEFJr3o5zxd6Oc8U\"/><figcaption>Brian爆粗答謝歌迷。（鍾冠全攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-26T14:00:24.946649+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":594,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}